{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11105300","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11105300","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110530001:1":{"text":"다들...","source_cn":"我……大家……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13B74CF4E524DC7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110530002:1":{"text":"... 세상에. 우선 가만히 있어!","source_cn":"……太好了。先别动！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F88B60AD1A9A125","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110530003:1":{"text":"소렌, 예전에...","source_cn":"索恩，之前……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39A13838E40AC756","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110530004:1":{"text":"얘기했잖아, 움직이면 안 돼!","source_cn":"我说了，先别动！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x757B395315EBEF98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110530005:1":{"text":"트라이브 꼬마가 독이 묻은 칼로 너를 찔렀어. 스모키가 해독제를 만들어주긴 했지만, 그래도 완전히 회복하려면 시간이 좀 필요해...","source_cn":"有个小蛮血用涂毒的匕首刺伤了你。阿熏配出了解药，不过完...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37BC5D96917F957D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110530006:1":{"text":"그래... 얼마나?","source_cn":"是吗……需要多久？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC652EBAE876AA18D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110530007:1":{"text":"그런 건 신경 쓰지 마! 지금 너한테 중요한 건 푹 쉬는 거야!","source_cn":"别管这些！你现在的任务就是好好休息！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1151B4DCF7EA8A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110530008:1":{"text":"군가 축제의 예선에... 지장은 없겠지?","source_cn":"不会耽误……战歌节初赛吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF819B3031E170D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1110530008":{"text":"군가 축제의 예선에... 지장은 없겠지?","source_cn":"不会耽误……战歌节初赛吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF819B3031E170D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110530009:1":{"text":"아르사...","source_cn":"阿尔萨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14CDB5A59F5D6830","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110530010:1":{"text":"나랑 소렌은... 절대 여기서 항복할 수 없어! 그렇지?","source_cn":"毕竟我和索恩——可不能在这个关头提前认输啊！对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3745BA523CED5FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110530011:1":{"text":"하... 당연하지. 예선 당일날, 내가 어떻게든 너를 데리고 갈 거라고.","source_cn":"呵……当然。初赛那天，我拎也要把你拎到赛场。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBD048E7960E259E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110530012:1":{"text":"아... 역시는 역시야 정말!","source_cn":"啊——不要不要！索恩大人饶命啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x383988BC595B4C9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110530013:1":{"text":"칼라, 예전에 그 음료수에 있었던 아주 소소한 문제 말인데...","source_cn":"那个，曼卡拉大人，关于我之前那些个小饮料的小小问题……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x901D172ECA0053E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110530014:1":{"text":"다시는 죄를 짓지 않겠다고 약속하면 이번은 용서해 줄게요. 하지만 또 똑같은 죄를 저지른다면 이때까지 저질렀던 모든 죄에 대해 벌을 내릴 거예요!","source_cn":"你保证不再犯，我这次就放过你。若敢再犯，数罪并罚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD538A963584C6286","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110530015:1":{"text":"지, 진짜? 정말 용서해주는 거야?","source_cn":"真、真的？真的放过我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1F96F7A1732E1DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110530016:1":{"text":"군가 축제의 중요한 참가자를 구했으니, 이 칼라가 소소한 관용을 베풀어 고마움을 전하는 거예요!","source_cn":"就当是曼卡拉的小小宽宥吧。你可是救了战歌节重要的参赛者！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1247890AC9A9C63D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110530017:1":{"text":"칼라 만세!","source_cn":"曼卡拉大人英明！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A6E84579396BF60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"이 상황에 군가 축제를 생각한다고?","source_cn":"还在想战歌节的事？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x29D7B988D856B31F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이 상황에 군가 축제를 생각한다고?","female":"이 상황에 군가 축제를 생각한다고?","variant_male_record_index":"63604","variant_female_record_index":"63605","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"아르사, 네 건강이 더 중요해","source_cn":"阿尔萨，身体要紧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x84F5256855E1ACA4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아르사, 네 건강이 더 중요해","female":"아르사, 네 건강이 더 중요해","variant_male_record_index":"63606","variant_female_record_index":"63607","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿熏":{"text":"스모키","source":"阿熏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:曼卡拉":{"te